{"id":"f3d5a180d568750e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/603_输入_输出逻辑_Input_Output_Logic.md","title":"603 输入 输出逻辑 Input Output Logic","display":"603_输入_输出逻辑_Input_Output_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>描述公式的原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\qquad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\qquad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规范对是二元句法对象而不是公式构造子；其载体与规范基参数在公式闭包之后给出。</p>\n<p>构造子完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{603},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{603},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{603},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{603},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-描述公式\">2. 描述公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>规范对集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pair}_{603}=\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Pair}_{603}=\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规范基参数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Pair}_{603}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Pair}_{603}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{603}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{603}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{603}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{603}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{603}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对规范对定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A,B)=(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A,B)=(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有绑定构造子，故</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{603}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{603}(A)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{603}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{603}(A)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,603}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,603}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{603}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{603}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{603},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{603}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{603}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{603}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{603},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{603}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-基础命题证明\">4. 基础命题证明</h1>\n<p>命题公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{603}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{603}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{603}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{603}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{603}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{603}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CPL}^{603}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{603}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{603}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{603}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CPL}^{603}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{603}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{603}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{603}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题分离规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{603}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{603}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\)</span> 出发的命题证明对象集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{CPL}^{603}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{CPL}^{603}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 由所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>组成，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\">\\(\\Delta_i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的有限子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\)</span>。每行满足以下之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{CPL}^{603}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{CPL}^{603}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>由此定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{CPL,603}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{CPL,603}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{CPL}^{603}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{CPL}^{603}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{CPL,603}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{CPL,603}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{CPL}^{603}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{CPL}^{603}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{CPL,603}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{CPL,603}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{CPL,603}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{CPL,603}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{CPL,603}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{CPL,603}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-输入/输出规则关系\">5. 输入/输出规则关系</h1>\n<p>对规范基 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\subseteq\\mathsf{Pair}_{603}\">\\(N\\subseteq\\mathsf{Pair}_{603}\\)</span>，定义以下规则关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"5.1-输入规则\">5.1 输入规则</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{In}^{N}\n=\n\\{((),(A,B)):(A,B)\\in N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{In}^{N}\n=\n\\{((),(A,B)):(A,B)\\in N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.2-输入强化\">5.2 输入强化</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{SI}^{603}\n=\n\\{(((A,B)),(C,B)):(A,B),(C,B)\\in\\mathsf{Pair}_{603},\\ \\varnothing\\vdash_{CPL,603}C\\to A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{SI}^{603}\n=\n\\{(((A,B)),(C,B)):(A,B),(C,B)\\in\\mathsf{Pair}_{603},\\ \\varnothing\\vdash_{CPL,603}C\\to A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.3-输出弱化\">5.3 输出弱化</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{WO}^{603}\n=\n\\{(((A,B)),(A,C)):(A,B),(A,C)\\in\\mathsf{Pair}_{603},\\ \\varnothing\\vdash_{CPL,603}B\\to C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{WO}^{603}\n=\n\\{(((A,B)),(A,C)):(A,B),(A,C)\\in\\mathsf{Pair}_{603},\\ \\varnothing\\vdash_{CPL,603}B\\to C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.4-输出合取\">5.4 输出合取</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{AND}^{603}\n=\n\\{(((A,B),(A,C)),(A,B\\land C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{AND}^{603}\n=\n\\{(((A,B),(A,C)),(A,B\\land C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.5-输入析取\">5.5 输入析取</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{OR}^{603}\n=\n\\{(((A,C),(B,C)),(A\\lor B,C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{OR}^{603}\n=\n\\{(((A,C),(B,C)),(A\\lor B,C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{IO}^{N}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{In}^{N}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{SI}^{603}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{WO}^{603}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{AND}^{603}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{OR}^{603}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{IO}^{N}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{In}^{N}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{SI}^{603}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{WO}^{603}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{AND}^{603}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{OR}^{603}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示分式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{}{(A,B)}\\;(In_N),\\quad\n\\frac{(A,B)\\quad\\vdash_{CPL,603}C\\to A}{(C,B)}\\;(SI),\\quad\n\\frac{(A,B)\\quad\\vdash_{CPL,603}B\\to C}{(A,C)}\\;(WO),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{}{(A,B)}\\;(In_N),\\quad\n\\frac{(A,B)\\quad\\vdash_{CPL,603}C\\to A}{(C,B)}\\;(SI),\\quad\n\\frac{(A,B)\\quad\\vdash_{CPL,603}B\\to C}{(A,C)}\\;(WO),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{(A,B)\\quad(A,C)}{(A,B\\land C)}\\;(AND),\\qquad\n\\frac{(A,C)\\quad(B,C)}{(A\\lor B,C)}\\;(OR).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{(A,B)\\quad(A,C)}{(A,B\\land C)}\\;(AND),\\qquad\n\\frac{(A,C)\\quad(B,C)}{(A\\lor B,C)}\\;(OR).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-输入/输出推导对象\">6. 输入/输出推导对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 出发的输入/输出推导对象集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{IO}^{603}(N)\">\\(\\mathsf{Der}_{IO}^{603}(N)\\)</span> 由所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(q_0,\\ldots,q_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho=(q_0,\\ldots,q_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>组成，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i\\in\\mathsf{Pair}_{603}\">\\(q_i\\in\\mathsf{Pair}_{603}\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i\">\\(q_i\\)</span> 满足以下之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i\\in N\">\\(q_i\\in N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_j=(A,B)\">\\(q_j=(A,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i=(C,B)\">\\(q_i=(C,B)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\vdash_{CPL,603}C\\to A\">\\(\\varnothing\\vdash_{CPL,603}C\\to A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_j=(A,B)\">\\(q_j=(A,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i=(A,C)\">\\(q_i=(A,C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\vdash_{CPL,603}B\\to C\">\\(\\varnothing\\vdash_{CPL,603}B\\to C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_j=(A,B)\">\\(q_j=(A,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_k=(A,C)\">\\(q_k=(A,C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i=(A,B\\land C)\">\\(q_i=(A,B\\land C)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_j=(A,C)\">\\(q_j=(A,C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_k=(B,C)\">\\(q_k=(B,C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i=(A\\lor B,C)\">\\(q_i=(A\\lor B,C)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-输入/输出可推出性\">7. 输入/输出可推出性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\vdash_{IO,603}(A,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\vdash_{IO,603}(A,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(q_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{IO}^{603}(N)\">\\(\\rho=(q_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{IO}^{603}(N)\\)</span> 令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{IO,603}(\\rho)=q_{m-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{IO,603}(\\rho)=q_{m-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{IO}^{603}(N)\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{IO}^{603}(N)\\)</span>，满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{IO,603}(\\rho)=(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{IO,603}(\\rho)=(A,B)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{IO,603}(N)=\\{((A,B),\\rho):(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Pair}_{603},\\ \n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{IO}^{603}(N),\\ \\operatorname{last}_{IO,603}(\\rho)=(A,B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{IO,603}(N)=\\{((A,B),\\rho):(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Pair}_{603},\\ \n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{IO}^{603}(N),\\ \\operatorname{last}_{IO,603}(\\rho)=(A,B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>输出集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_{603}(N,A)\n=\n\\{B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}:N\\vdash_{IO,603}(A,B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{out}_{603}(N,A)\n=\n\\{B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}:N\\vdash_{IO,603}(A,B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-语义闭包\">8. 语义闭包</h1>\n<p>定义命题赋值集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{603}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{603}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}A\">\\(v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}A\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{603}\">\\(v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{603}\\)</span> 递归定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nv(p)=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nv(p)=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v\\not\\Vdash_{CPL,603}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v\\not\\Vdash_{CPL,603}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nv\\not\\Vdash_{CPL,603}A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nv\\not\\Vdash_{CPL,603}A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(v\\not\\Vdash_{CPL,603}A\\ \\lor\\ v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(v\\not\\Vdash_{CPL,603}A\\ \\lor\\ v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义蕴涵为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models_{CPL,603}B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{603}\\,(v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}A\\Rightarrow v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models_{CPL,603}B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{603}\\,(v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}A\\Rightarrow v\\Vdash_{CPL,603}B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对规范基 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>，定义语义输入/输出闭包 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OutSem}_{603}(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{OutSem}_{603}(N)\\)</span> 为包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 的最小关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathsf{Pair}_{603}\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathsf{Pair}_{603}\\)</span>，并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in R\\land C\\models_{CPL,603}A\\Rightarrow(C,B)\\in R,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in R\\land C\\models_{CPL,603}A\\Rightarrow(C,B)\\in R,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in R\\land B\\models_{CPL,603}C\\Rightarrow(A,C)\\in R,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in R\\land B\\models_{CPL,603}C\\Rightarrow(A,C)\\in R,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in R\\land(A,C)\\in R\\Rightarrow(A,B\\land C)\\in R,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in R\\land(A,C)\\in R\\Rightarrow(A,B\\land C)\\in R,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,C)\\in R\\land(B,C)\\in R\\Rightarrow(A\\lor B,C)\\in R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,C)\\in R\\land(B,C)\\in R\\Rightarrow(A\\lor B,C)\\in R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义输出与语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}^{sem}_{603}(N,A)=\\{B:(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{OutSem}_{603}(N)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{out}^{sem}_{603}(N,A)=\\{B:(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{OutSem}_{603}(N)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\models_{IO,603}(A,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\operatorname{out}^{sem}_{603}(N,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\models_{IO,603}(A,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\operatorname{out}^{sem}_{603}(N,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的主判断不是公式定理性，而是规范对推出性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\vdash_{IO,603}(A,B)\">\\(N\\vdash_{IO,603}(A,B)\\)</span>。它用输入强化、输出弱化、合取和析取规则生成输出，而不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\">\\((A,B)\\)</span> 内化为模态公式。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-合规说明\">10. 合规说明</h1>\n<p>所有命题等价、合取和析取均由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg,\\to\">\\(\\bot,\\neg,\\to\\)</span> 展开；输入/输出规则的侧条件只引用第 4 节定义的本地命题可证性。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{IO}_{603}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{603},\\mathsf{Pair}_{603},\\operatorname{FV}_{603},\\operatorname{BV}_{603},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{603},\\operatorname{Sub}_{603},\\equiv_{\\alpha,603},\\mathsf{Ax}_{CPL}^{603},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{603},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{CPL}^{603},\\operatorname{last}_{CPL,603},\\vdash_{CPL,603},\\mathsf{Thm}_{CPL,603},\nN,\\mathsf{Rule}_{IO}^{N},\\mathsf{Der}_{IO}^{603},\\operatorname{last}_{IO,603},\\vdash_{IO,603},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{IO,603},\\operatorname{out}_{603},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{603},\\Vdash_{CPL,603},\\operatorname{OutSem}_{603},\\operatorname{out}^{sem}_{603},\\models_{IO,603}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{IO}_{603}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{603},\\mathsf{Pair}_{603},\\operatorname{FV}_{603},\\operatorname{BV}_{603},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{603},\\operatorname{Sub}_{603},\\equiv_{\\alpha,603},\\mathsf{Ax}_{CPL}^{603},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{603},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{CPL}^{603},\\operatorname{last}_{CPL,603},\\vdash_{CPL,603},\\mathsf{Thm}_{CPL,603},\nN,\\mathsf{Rule}_{IO}^{N},\\mathsf{Der}_{IO}^{603},\\operatorname{last}_{IO,603},\\vdash_{IO,603},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{IO,603},\\operatorname{out}_{603},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{603},\\Vdash_{CPL,603},\\operatorname{OutSem}_{603},\\operatorname{out}^{sem}_{603},\\models_{IO,603}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含公式、规范对、规则推导、输出闭包、命题赋值语义和输入/输出语义闭包；不把规范对内化为道义真值公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-描述公式","text":"2. 描述公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-基础命题证明","text":"4. 基础命题证明","level":1},{"id":"5.-输入/输出规则关系","text":"5. 输入/输出规则关系","level":1},{"id":"5.1-输入规则","text":"5.1 输入规则","level":2},{"id":"5.2-输入强化","text":"5.2 输入强化","level":2},{"id":"5.3-输出弱化","text":"5.3 输出弱化","level":2},{"id":"5.4-输出合取","text":"5.4 输出合取","level":2},{"id":"5.5-输入析取","text":"5.5 输入析取","level":2},{"id":"6.-输入/输出推导对象","text":"6. 输入/输出推导对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-输入/输出可推出性","text":"7. 输入/输出可推出性","level":1},{"id":"8.-语义闭包","text":"8. 语义闭包","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-合规说明","text":"10. 合规说明","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\qquad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),","display":true},{"tex":"A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),","display":true},{"tex":"A\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),","display":true},{"tex":"A\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{603},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{603},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{603}\\to\\ma